e men's leather trousers, laced at the side","category":"Leather Pants","categorySlug":"leather-pants","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nIn a used look\r\nVintage look\r\nBrown base color with a vintage look\r\nsoft and thick nappa leather\r\nLaced at the sides\r\n5 Pocket Jeans\r\n5 pockets, 2 in the front, 2 in the back, 1 small pocket in the front which is located inside the larger pocket in the front.\r\nThe trousers can be closed at the top with a button and a zipper.\r\nThese leather trousers have a standard length of at least L34, meaning you can simply cut them to your desired length and attach the hem with strong glue (or of course, you can sew them).\r\nPolyester lining that reaches down to the knee.\r\nAmerican inch size\r\n\r\n\r\nConverting the inch size of your pants to centimeters is easy. Multiply the width (W) by 2.5, and you'll have the waist circumference.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\nW34 × 2.5 = 85 cm waist circumference.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["29","30","31","32","33","34","36","38","40","42","44","46"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-811-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-811-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-811-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LP-812","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-jeans-leather-trousers-side-laced-pcp-lp-812","name":"Men's Biker Leather Jeans Leather Trousers Side Laced","category":"Leather Pants","categorySlug":"leather-pants","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nBlack base color\r\nThick yet soft nappa leather\r\nLaced at the sides\r\n5 Pocket Jeans\r\n5 pockets, 2 in the front, 2 in the back, 1 small pocket in the front which is located inside the larger pocket in the front.\r\nThe trousers can be closed at the top with a button and a zipper.\r\nThese leather trousers have a standard length of at least L34, meaning you can simply cut them to your desired length and attach the hem with strong glue (or of course, you can sew them).\r\nPolyester lining that reaches down to the knee.\r\nSeamless knees\r\nAmerican inch size\r\n\r\nConverting the inch size of your pants to centimeters is easy. Multiply the width (W) by 2.5, and you'll have the waist circumference.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\nW34 × 2.5 = 85 cm waist circumference.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["29","30","31","32","33","34","36","38","40","42","44","47"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-812-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-812-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-812-3.jpg"],"featured":true}],"fixedCollection":"leather-pants"}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden bg-ink py-16 text-white","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 hidden w-1/3 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,149,60,0.28),rgba(138,90,51,0.08))] lg:block"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container-pad relative flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow mb-3 text-brass","children":"Private Label Manufacturing"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-black leading-tight sm:text-5xl","children":"Develop your pants line with PrimeCraft Partners"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-white/72","children":"From neck labels and hang tags to 